   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Caption Speaker\n\nDialogue captions where every phrase takes its speaker's color, so a conversation reads like a script.\n\nCategory: captions. Length: 9.4 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- An interview, podcast clip or two-person demo where the viewer has to know who is talking without seeing their mouth.\n- Your transcript already has speaker labels from diarization and you want them to carry through to the screen.\n\nAvoid when:\n- Only one person speaks: use caption-karaoke, which spends the color on the voice's progress instead.\n- You want plain, neutral subtitles for an explainer: use caption-subtitle.\n\nVariables:\n- captions (string): Captions, default \"[{\\\"text\\\":\\\" So\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":300,\\\"endMs\\\":460,\\\"speaker\\\":\\\"host\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\" what\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":460,\\\"endMs\\\":640,\\\"speaker\\\":\\\"host\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\" made\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":640,\\\"endMs\\\":860,\\\"speaker\\\":\\\"host\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\" you\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":860,\\\"endMs\\\":980,\\\"speaker\\\":\\\"host\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\" add\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":980,\\\"endMs\\\":1180,\\\"speaker\\\":\\\"host\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\" captions?\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":1180,\\\"endMs\\\":1800,\\\"speaker\\\":\\\"host\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\" Most\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":2300,\\\"endMs\\\":2560,\\\"speaker\\\":\\\"guest\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\" people\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":2560,\\\"endMs\\\":2900,\\\"speaker\\\":\\\"guest\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\" watch\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":2900,\\\"endMs\\\":3160,\\\"speaker\\\":\\\"guest\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\" with\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":3160,\\\"endMs\\\":3280,\\\"speaker\\\":\\\"guest\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\" the\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":3280,\\\"endMs\\\":3380,\\\"speaker\\\":\\\"guest\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\" sound\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":3380,\\\"endMs\\\":3720,\\\"speaker\\\":\\\"guest\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\" off.\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":3720,\\\"endMs\\\":4240,\\\"speaker\\\":\\\"guest\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\" Really?\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":4800,\\\"endMs\\\":5400,\\\"speaker\\\":\\\"host\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\" Almost\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":5800,\\\"endMs\\\":6140,\\\"speaker\\\":\\\"guest\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\" everyone.\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":6140,\\\"endMs\\\":6760,\\\"speaker\\\":\\\"guest\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\" Captions\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":7000,\\\"endMs\\\":7480,\\\"speaker\\\":\\\"guest\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\" keep\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":7480,\\\"endMs\\\":7700,\\\"speaker\\\":\\\"guest\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\" them\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":7700,\\\"endMs\\\":7860,\\\"speaker\\\":\\\"guest\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\" watching.\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":7860,\\\"endMs\\\":8400,\\\"speaker\\\":\\\"guest\\\"}]\"\n- font_size (number, 24-140): Font size, default 64\n- font_weight (number, 400-900): Font weight, default 800\n- color (color): Text color, default \"#ffffff\"\n- combine_tokens_within_milliseconds (number, 0-3000): Page window, default 1200\n- hold_ms (number, 0-2000): Hold, default 600\n- shadow (boolean): Shadow, default true\n- speaker_colors (string): Speaker colors, default \"{}\"\n- upcoming_opacity (number, 0-1): Upcoming opacity, default 0.4\n\nSource: https://github.com/Remocn/remocn. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
